      "text": "Squirrels chewing wires is a common cause of sudden electrical faults, damaged outdoor lighting, and costly car repairs. If you have seen frayed cables in your attic, chewed holiday lights, or unexplained shorts in exterior wiring, start by scheduling a professional inspection on our ",
