      "text": "Reddit discussions show that many popular DIY repellents provide inconsistent results. Peppermint oil, cayenne, and ultrasonic devices sometimes delay chewing but seldom stop a determined squirrel that has found shelter and food. Effective prevention combines exclusion, habitat modification, and durable physical protection.",
